{"title":"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Official_MAA)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Official MAA)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Quick_way_to_notice_recursion_loop\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quick way to notice recursion loop</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define a sequence recursively by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/f/46fc6b55a7ca6d2692c76de6862d12c2f3b211e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/579f355d11caa513986dc20cf84beaf169f8660b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_2 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, and<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/5/055d678205c203b8399cd576b7812bb54597c68a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_n = \\frac{5t_{n-1}+1}{25t_{n-2}}\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"40\" />for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f1e2533d6abdb11a9a1626c0240fab1a9200fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/9/749cbf7881e55d4e3138c64adb11294dc30bf4a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_{2020}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/7347a1d5586e82c832f61ea799d89945ed2837fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p}{q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"11\" height=\"36\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/0/170200756543596efeb46fca1cf29a617e8c9192.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/1/a410484dc296d3b3b726d31abe31f3d241d325ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_n=\\frac{s_n}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"63\" height=\"34\" />. Then, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16f11ccd47d2543b0e7d80593690fbb364e21563.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_n=\\frac{s_{n-1}+1}{s_{n-2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"110\" height=\"39\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ceb910198c51acc03703608eaf9e26204348bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_1 = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/1/c51fdb4b6f6a086665126096df1b3e4097f1875b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_2 = 105$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />. By substitution, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/c/72cbab41d324a75f7d63056508732f9bf70b9538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_3 = \\frac{53}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"60\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/1/9f1423a51d44dd096271bfc763d681c3cf57670b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_4=\\frac{103}{105\\cdot50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/1/d71b7687eb5715b41c6189f5a96b4b2fb42ad915.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_5=\\frac{101}{105}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/c/1ec46d982b72f86b9853767a80c7afbaaded439f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_6=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d568149cc363e02c5c3842c35f68eb016dc68608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_7=105$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"15\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/4/d24f09efdef5385985d3f51f9163958f3aaa64a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> has a period of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffdb0404e7b2f3013da9d894006e979d24f5c8ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_{2020}=s_5=\\frac{101}{105}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"130\" height=\"38\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9a35114f77239ea8f6418039e67e87d54f9f764.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{101}{105\\cdot 5}\\implies 101+525=\\boxed{626}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"244\" height=\"38\" />.\n~mn28407\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Official_MAA.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Official_MAA)\">Solution 2 (Official MAA)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Official MAA)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>More generally, let the first two terms be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in the recursive formula by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e5c83cc0c639fc2ed843bbe2d3d209fb478b104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" />, respectively. Then some algebraic calculation shows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/40924c3e1fae185be9e394165b43550f809b1cbd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_3 = \\frac{b\\,k+1}{a\\, k^2},~~t_4 = \\frac{a\\, k + b\\,k+1}{a\\,b\\, k^3},~~ t_5 = \\frac{a\\,k+1}{b\\, k^2},~~ t_6 = a, \\text{~ and ~}t_7 =b,\\]\" width=\"531\" height=\"37\" />so the sequence is periodic with period <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b639f7e61e275375e8af1059506f54bd60d1d7f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_{2020} = t_{5} =  \\frac{20\\cdot 5 +1}{21\\cdot  25} = \\frac{101}{525}.\\]\" width=\"231\" height=\"38\" />The requested sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/5/fc58b7866a2d050e421bd96f84c765ec5563b017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101+525=626$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us examine the first few terms of this sequence and see if we can find a pattern. We are obviously given <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/f/46fc6b55a7ca6d2692c76de6862d12c2f3b211e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/9/579f355d11caa513986dc20cf84beaf169f8660b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_2 = 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />, so now we are able to determine the numerical value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e51a3ca6ab05c0125032af6cc66844243477601d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> using this information:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/6/e766ec551a41182bb620bcd692b0ac1b5300ed22.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_3 = \\frac{5t_{3-1}+1}{25t_{3-2}} = \\frac{5t_{2}+1}{25t_{1}} = \\frac{5(21) + 1}{25(20)} = \\frac{105 + 1}{500}t_3 = \\frac{106}{500}  = \\frac{53}{250}\\]\" width=\"507\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/44629b2056315e876d879e0468a6769c67c55ec9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_4 = \\frac{5t_{4-1}+1}{25t_{4-2}} = \\frac{5t_{3}+1}{25t_{2}} = \\frac{5(\\frac{53}{250}) + 1}{25(21)} = \\frac{\\frac{53}{50} + 1}{525} = \\frac{\\frac{103}{50}}{525} = \\frac{103}{26250}\\]\" width=\"507\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/c/64cb45dc1a8286cbbbda0d90255dabb53ba95b31.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_5 = \\frac{5t_{5-1}+1}{25t_{5-2}} = \\frac{5t_{4}+1}{25t_{3}} = \\frac{5(\\frac{103}{26250}) + 1}{25(\\frac{53}{250})} = \\frac{\\frac{103}{5250} + 1}{\\frac{53}{10}} = \\frac{\\frac{5353}{5250}}{\\frac{53}{10}} = \\frac{101}{525}\\]\" width=\"518\" height=\"47\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/d/59de7185b9ca264782289671efc575cae9c17845.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_6 = \\frac{5t_{6-1}+1}{25t_{6-2}} = \\frac{5t_{5}+1}{25t_{4}} = \\frac{5(\\frac{101}{525}) + 1}{25(\\frac{103}{26250})} = \\frac{\\frac{101}{105} + 1}{\\frac{103}{1050}} = \\frac{\\frac{206}{105}}{\\frac{103}{1050}} \\implies t_6 = 20\\]\" width=\"550\" height=\"47\" />\n</p><p>Alas, we have figured this sequence is period 5! But since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e637b925613ca6633aea0d8dc814aebbf8c1ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2020 \\equiv 5 \\pmod 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"144\" height=\"20\" />, we can state that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888d4dfc46ad0f96284ab5fe3fc96c13821a9c38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_{2020} = t_5 = \\frac{101}{525}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"37\" />. According to the original problem statement, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/b/2db1847073fe85cea94afd5bf41ff72e14496ee3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{626}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />. ~ nikenissan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like solution 1, we will make a substitution. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea2682286c944acdc9dc111447438cdc10c92803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_n = 5t_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"17\" />. Then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/3/27332a0caf010a3a2b7a34c63917d466985a5b6b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u_n = \\frac{25t_{n-1} + 5}{25t_{n-2}} = \\frac{u_{n-1} + 1}{u_{n-2}}\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/010b6cc4c72d50439bd4bfcded49c1c63ee98645.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_1 = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/5/095cabf7aa4d5d72b4dc2fb390702318de8cd8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_2 = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />. The following holds for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/1/8f1e2533d6abdb11a9a1626c0240fab1a9200fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />. Then,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/2/672a4f7030add12f6d0593d42324a12133990a0a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u_3 = \\frac{b+1}{a}\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/2/cc21079a0ee5c0ddb291f968e4c73b3348f2c458.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u_4 = \\frac{\\frac{b+1+a}{a}}{b} = \\frac{b+1+a}{ab}\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"41\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b9595d722a6403ee7bb4a5dd8aacddf705e859f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u_5 = \\frac{\\frac{b+1+a+ab}{ab}}{\\frac{b+1}{a}} = \\frac{\\frac{(b+1)(a+1)}{ab}}{\\frac{b+1}{a}} = \\frac{(b+1)(a+1)}{ab} \\cdot \\frac{a}{b+1} = \\frac{a+1}{b}\\]\" width=\"472\" height=\"50\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/7/5175eb404aebea88fe6efb4d6159cd74db11f8cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[u_6 = \\frac{\\frac{a+1+b}{b}}{\\frac{b+1+a}{ab}} = \\frac{a+1+b}{b} \\cdot \\frac{ab}{b+1+a} = a\\]\" width=\"310\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/6/4a62a262f68e1adce9d45fadca13dcfd7cc99ce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is periodic with periodicity 5.\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/8/6d8665b100fd78dcf71051134253209a3e57c971.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_{2020} = u_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79c0f6b96b5c787998ea85a646b86bb740db78a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_{2020} = t_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf58b42a89ba74c9dd2cfbbd537fd4c525bce1cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_1 = 5t_1 = 100 = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/d/4cdf8d90d07e9f9fcb5394f2ee6f08ffc47c13b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u_2 = 5t_2 = 105 = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"17\" />. Then,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a243918f0247d349f89772515bf94b312d3e2bd5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5t_5 = \\frac{101}{105}\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/120c8bf3873b23419fe9eb684f992b49c9ce16d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[t_5 = \\frac{101}{525}\\]\" width=\"68\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>And thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/888d4dfc46ad0f96284ab5fe3fc96c13821a9c38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_{2020} = t_5 = \\frac{101}{525}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"126\" height=\"37\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92b082a9f50e5a62292680488fcc9708efa78a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101 + 525 = \\boxed{626}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"141\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_JTWJxbDC1A\">https://youtu.be/_JTWJxbDC1A</a> ~ CNCM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/__B3pJMpfSk\">https://youtu.be/__B3pJMpfSk</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quick_way_to_notice_recursion_loop\">Quick way to notice recursion loop</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Quick way to notice recursion loop\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Round the first two values to both be 20. Then, the next element can be rounded to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d129a7b3c0bf9fbd0693afdd426a66d2a0a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/5/0852123751116adab4f7e1723d094f9341fbebfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> can then be quickly calculated to around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96ed0b77757db4cc09dd52eb9536cb9894d4a454.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{250}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/a/58ab5ba702b6ebd1adaa3fb94ee163786c98c55e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> can be rounded to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d129a7b3c0bf9fbd0693afdd426a66d2a0a8c3ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/6/7b695168c63cbcdd494702bd41e29e78b7f35a84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> turns out to be around 20, which means that there is probably a loop with period 5. The rest of the solution proceeds normally.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II\" title=\"2020 AIME II\">2020 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017154510\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.265 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 423/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 12989/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.523      1 -total\n 64.75%   26.885      1 Template:AIME_box\n 33.98%   14.111      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18843:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017154510 and revision id 280271. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}